      "value": "there is a way to add custom dynamic bone limiting factors (see vrchat's official docs on how to do so in here: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/configuration-file ), but it can be a hefty proces for alot of users, so a GUI option ingame with sliders on the dynamic bone limit enable toggle would be oh se lovely to have.",
